        "body": "This PR restructures the import structure of squlearn.\r\n\r\nThe major changes include:\r\n- easy imports for high-level API (i.e. sklearn interface classes)\r\n- more detailed imports necessary for low-level API e.g.\r\n  - Base classes\r\n  - helper functions\r\n\r\nPlease check your part of the code, if the proposed changes work for you. Open to discuss changes.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\ncloses #35",
